      "content": "hey my son is sick and the doctor gave us some liquid amoxicillin but i'm so confused lol. the bottle says 400mg/5ml but i don't know how much to actually give him. he weighs 15kg and the doctor said he needs 40mg per kg every day. can u tell me exactly how many ml he needs for each dose? i need to give it to him every 8 hours.",
